Cyclic cross-reference resolves to one level

```
# A </#a>
.
<section id="A">
  <h1>A <a href="#A">A </a></h1>
</section>
```

```
# A </#b>

# B </#a>
.
<section id="A">
  <h1>A <a href="#B">B </a></h1>
</section>
<section id="B">
  <h1>B <a href="#A">A </a></h1>
</section>
```

```
# Intro

See </#intro>.
.
<section id="Intro">
  <h1>Intro</h1>
  <p>See <a href="#Intro">Intro</a>.</p>
</section>
```
